English vocabulary
==================

Standard vocabulary
-------------------

Source: Alt12Dicts 2of12full.txt, version 2020.12.07, by Alan Beale,
packaged by Kevin Atkinson:
https://github.com/en-wl/wordlist/blob/v1/alt12dicts/2of12full.txt

The upstream Alt12Dicts README states: "All of these files have been
explicitly placed in the Public Domain by Alan Beale." This is the source's
stated rights dedication; the source does not name a separate SPDX identifier
or attach additional license terms.

The included Standard data is `packages/language-packs/src/en/words.json`.
It contains lowercase ASCII entries of 2–9 letters. Entries in
`packages/language-packs/src/en/BLOCKLIST.json` are removed. That blocklist
includes the Kids Tier A exclusions recorded in
`packages/language-packs/src/en/kids-list-problem-words.txt`. Standard
letter-pattern statistics are calculated from the resulting word list.

Kids allowlist
--------------

Frequency source: `large_en.msgpack.gz` from wordfreq, snapshot commit
`912caf64b657478d1dff1138efdc078947d54bb1`, by Robyn Speer:
https://github.com/rspeer/wordfreq/blob/912caf64b657478d1dff1138efdc078947d54bb1/wordfreq/data/large_en.msgpack.gz
Upstream attribution and license notice:
https://github.com/rspeer/wordfreq/blob/912caf64b657478d1dff1138efdc078947d54bb1/NOTICE.md

The upstream notice records the data license as: "redistributed under a
